1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,006
Bang!

2
00:00:01,118 --> 00:00:02,942
Kenapa WiFi mamak ni hilang!

3
00:00:03,114 --> 00:00:06,930
Aku tak boleh scan QR ni, macam mana nak
bayar teh tarik ni!

4
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:07,869
Haa...

5
00:00:07,899 --> 00:00:09,310
Tu baru WiFi kedai.

6
00:00:09,604 --> 00:00:11,865
Cuba bayangkan kalau internet hilang...

7
00:00:12,015 --> 00:00:13,530
dari seluruh bumi.

8
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,545
Minit pertama.

9
00:00:14,345 --> 00:00:17,943
WhatsApp, TikTok, Instagram.

10
00:00:17,743 --> 00:00:18,657
Semua senyap.

11
00:00:18,457 --> 00:00:21,078
Takde notification langsung.

12
00:00:20,878 --> 00:00:24,264
Mesej semua tersangkut, ada ikon jam je
yang bergerak.

13
00:00:24,364 --> 00:00:26,312
Alah, takpe lah...

14
00:00:26,456 --> 00:00:27,790
Aku tidur je lah...

15
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:28,858
Jam pertama.

16
00:00:28,658 --> 00:00:33,932
QR tak jalan, kad tak jalan, semua kedai
cuma terima

17
00:00:33,732 --> 00:00:34,624
cash je...

18
00:00:34,724 --> 00:00:36,006
Alamak...

19
00:00:35,954 --> 00:00:39,048
Aku dah la ada RM3 je dalam dompet ni...

20
00:00:39,148 --> 00:00:41,193
Dan benda ni pernah jadi tau!

21
00:00:41,484 --> 00:00:46,209
Tahun 2021, WhatsApp, Facebook dan
Instagram hilang

22
00:00:46,009 --> 00:00:47,368
hampir 6 jam.

23
00:00:47,706 --> 00:00:50,061
Tiga setengah bilion orang terkesan.

24
00:00:50,161 --> 00:00:54,590
Menurut founder Telegram, 70 juta orang
terus lari ke Telegram!

25
00:00:54,761 --> 00:00:56,187
Dalam satu hari je...

26
00:00:56,287 --> 00:00:59,736
Tu baru 6 jam je, macam mana kalau
sehari?!

27
00:00:59,836 --> 00:01:00,700
Sehari.

28
00:01:01,018 --> 00:01:03,924
Tiket flight, penghantaran barang, gudang.

29
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:08,157
Semua yang guna sistem online, semuanya
akan jadi slow.

30
00:01:08,257 --> 00:01:09,070
Seminggu.

31
00:01:08,870 --> 00:01:12,764
Lori tak tahu nak hantar apa dan ke mana.

32
00:01:12,564 --> 00:01:14,543
Rak kedai semua mula kosong.

33
00:01:14,643 --> 00:01:17,583
Bang, internet ni sebenarnya duduk kat
mana?

34
00:01:17,797 --> 00:01:18,755
Dekat langit ke?

35
00:01:18,855 --> 00:01:19,776
Hehehe.

36
00:01:19,697 --> 00:01:20,950
Bukan.

37
00:01:21,176 --> 00:01:25,627
Lebih 99% data antara benua lalu kabel
bawah laut.

38
00:01:25,937 --> 00:01:26,672
Saiz dia?

39
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:28,632
Lebih kurang hos paip je.

40
00:01:28,732 --> 00:01:31,627
Habis tu, kalau jerung gigit macam mana?

41
00:01:31,727 --> 00:01:32,971
Jerung?

42
00:01:32,771 --> 00:01:35,735
Data dari 2007 sampai 2014, kosong kes.

43
00:01:35,535 --> 00:01:40,898
Yang selalu putuskan kabel ialah sauh
kapal dan bot nelayan.

44
00:01:40,698 --> 00:01:42,860
Dan pernah sekali...

45
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:46,137
satu negara terus terputus dari dunia.

46
00:01:46,337 --> 00:01:47,448
Nak tahu cerita tu?

47
00:01:47,753 --> 00:01:49,453
Follow, tunggu Part 2.
